        "y0": 0.800489725488605,
        "x1": 0.29857832466075623,
        "y1": 0.8105906091555201
      },
      "text": "a senior officer and Director of Research at Rwanda",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.326817805470984,
        "y0": 0.7948054304026594,
        "x1": 0.9092205521327997,
        "y1": 0.8068003798976089
      },
      "text": "Among study participants, 96.5% were circumcised by non-physician operators, 85.4%",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05882310555651297,
        "y0": 0.814376418036644,
        "x1": 0.24741550520354627,
        "y1": 0.824477301703559
      },
      "text": "Military Hospital (mpacific5@gmail.com).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.326817805470984,
        "y0": 0.8124859935105448,
        "x1": 0.9046646566951976,
        "y1": 0.8244809430054945
      },
      "text": "were under 30years, 98.9% were HIV-negative and 97.9% were without any urological",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05882310555651297,
        "y0": 0.8358508902366715,
        "x1": 0.300710291644327,
        "y1": 0.8459517739035867
      },
      "text": "Funding: These authors have no support or funding",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
